<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00701">
	<title>Parking Safety button</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e04157">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e04158">
								<image href="images/N_SP327_D10_039_1_E.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>Press the Parking Safety (<image href="images/WKIA_087.jpg" scale="15" align="left" placement="inline"/>) button to turn <term translate="no">ON</term> Parking Distance Warning. Press the button again to turn <term translate="no">OFF</term> the function.</p>
		<p>When you shift the gear to R (Reverse), Parking Distance Warning automatically turns <term translate="no">ON</term> (the Parking Safety button indicator is <term translate="no">ON</term>).</p>
	</conbody>
	<related-links>
		<linkpool>
			<link format="dita" href="t00700.dita#t00700" role="parent" scope="local" type="concept">
				<linktext>Parking Distance Warning operation</linktext>
			</link>
		</linkpool>
	</related-links>
</concept>